msgctxt "76"
msgid ""
"Oh, Kiryu-san... I've heard the rumors about how heated you can get... But "
"now that you've shared some of that heat with me... It feels like I'm "
"burning up inside. <Color:255,200,200,255>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88"
msgid "Heh... Not sure what you're referencing, but call it what you like."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid ""
"Thanks, Kiryu-san... I'll never forget the beautiful memories we made. "
"<Color:255,200,200,255>⑮<Color:Default><Color:255,200,200,255>⑮<Color:Default><Color:255,200,200,255>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid "We sure made a lot of something, didn't we?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid ""
"Ahaha. Ya can be so clumsy with your words sometimes... But at least you're "
"an expert on what really matters. <Color:255,200,200,255>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid ""
"Guess that means I love ya, Kiryu-san. Never forget that. "
"<Color:255,200,200,255>⑮<Color:Default><Color:255,200,200,255>⑮<Color:Default><Color:255,200,200,255>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid "You got 5,000 EXP."
msgstr ""

